+    /// Bitmap data (grayscale or RGBA). Shared via `Arc` so cloning a
+    /// `CachedGlyph` out of the cache (to release the cache borrow) is a
+    /// cheap refcount bump instead of a heap copy of the pixel data.
+    pub bitmap: Arc<[u8]>,
+    /// Bitmap format
