+//! - `csi`: CSI (Control Sequence Introducer) sequences
+//! - `osc`: OSC (Operating System Command) sequences
+//! - `esc`: ESC (Escape) sequences
+//! - `dcs`: DCS (Device Control String) sequences (primarily Sixel graphics)
+
